#: ../developer/context-recall.md:1
msgid "Native conversation recall"
msgstr "原生会话的上下文记忆"

#: ../developer/context-recall.md:3
msgid ""
"Each chat's native CLI session lives in its retained sandbox. The CLI "
"owns the conversation history; Cloud Agent passes each user message "
"through unchanged and never replays transcripts, rewrites JSONL or adds a"
" continuation reminder."
msgstr ""
"每个对话的原生 CLI 会话都保存在它的保留沙箱中。对话历史归 CLI 所有；Cloud Agent 原样传递每条用户消息，从不重放对话记录、改写"
" JSONL 或添加续接提示。"

#: ../developer/context-recall.md:7
msgid ""
"When an answer seems to forget earlier turns, ask two separate questions:"
" did the same native session survive, and did the model answer correctly "
"from the history it was sent? An investigation in September 2026 found "
"both kinds of failure: bugs in native session persistence, and models "
"claiming history was missing when the request carried all of it. The "
"session architecture is in the [native Fork and shared workspace "
"design](../agents/specs/2026-08-31-native-session-fork-shared-workspace-"
"design.md)."
msgstr ""
"回答看起来忘了之前的轮次时，要分别问两个问题：同一个原生会话是否还在？模型是否根据收到的历史正确作答？2026 年 9 "
"月的一次调查两类问题都发现了：既有原生会话持久化的缺陷，也有模型在请求带着完整历史时仍声称历史缺失的情况。会话架构见[原生 Fork "
"与共享工作区设计](../agents/specs/2026-08-31-native-session-fork-shared-"
"workspace-design.md)。"

