msgid "Context status"
msgstr "上下文状态"

#: ../developer/context-recall.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/context-recall.md
msgid "`NEW`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/context-recall.md
msgid "No native turn has previously settled for this member"
msgstr "这个成员之前还没有完成过任何原生轮次"

#: ../developer/context-recall.md
msgid "`LIVE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/context-recall.md
msgid "The turn uses the compatible resident CLI process"
msgstr "这一轮用的是仍在运行、且兼容的 CLI 进程"

#: ../developer/context-recall.md
msgid "`RESTORED`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/context-recall.md
msgid "A replacement process resumes the retained native session"
msgstr "新起的进程接上了保留下来的原生会话"

#: ../developer/context-recall.md
msgid "`LOST`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/context-recall.md
msgid ""
"Required native state or container integrity cannot be established; "
"execution is refused"
msgstr "无法确认所需的原生状态或容器完整性，拒绝执行"

#: ../developer/context-recall.md:23
msgid ""
"Stopping a container keeps its writable layer. Losing the container or "
"the Docker data root loses the native state, unless the group was stopped"
" cleanly with a current [restorable checkpoint](operations.md#restoring-a"
"-removed-hosts-sandboxes), which another host can restore once this one "
"is removed, terminates or moves out before its lease ends."
msgstr ""
"停止容器会保留其可写层。丢失容器或 Docker "
"数据根目录就会丢失原生状态，除非该组是干净停止的，并且有当前可用的[可恢复检查点](operations.md#restoring-a"
"-removed-hosts-sandboxes)：在本主机被移除、终止或在租约到期前迁出之后，另一台主机可以恢复它。"

#: ../developer/context-recall.md:30
msgid "Session identity"
msgstr "会话标识"

#: ../developer/context-recall.md:32
msgid ""
"After each turn settles, including one that settled normally after an API"
" failure, the runner checks the native session ID before saving it. A "
"continuation that reports a different ID fails the turn before it can "
"replace the saved locator."
msgstr ""
"每个轮次结束后（包括在 API 失败后正常结束的轮次），runner 先检查原生会话 ID 再保存。续接时报告的 ID "
"不同，该轮次就会失败，来不及替换已保存的定位信息。"

#: ../developer/context-recall.md:36
msgid ""
"When a launch omits the locator, the sandbox manager uses the member's "
"saved one, rejects a conflict between the requested and observed "
"locators, and checks again at settlement. The runner rejects a retained "
"chat with no resume locator."
msgstr ""
"启动时没有给出定位信息，sandbox manager "
"会使用该成员已保存的值，拒绝请求的与观察到的定位信息之间的冲突，并在结束时再检查一次。runner 会拒绝没有恢复定位信息的保留对话。"

#: ../developer/context-recall.md:40
msgid ""
"The Claude driver checks root stream events before normalizing them, so a"
" child agent's events (`parent_tool_use_id`) cannot replace the root "
"session ID. The other adapters validate their own resume handshakes."
msgstr ""
"Claude 驱动在规范化之前检查根流事件，所以子 agent 的事件（`parent_tool_use_id`）无法替换根会话 "
"ID。其他适配器各自校验自己的恢复握手。"

#: ../developer/context-recall.md:44
msgid "Failed turns"
msgstr "失败的轮次"

#: ../developer/context-recall.md:46
msgid ""
"All five CLIs keep the native session after a failed turn, so a follow-up"
" can continue it, but only when the native turn verifiably ended, "
"activation cleanup completed, and the transport and native locator are "
"still usable. A command rejection, dead transport, timeout or "
"cancellation is not settlement."
msgstr ""
"五个 CLI "
"在轮次失败后都会保留原生会话，让后续消息可以接着进行，但前提是原生轮次确实已结束、激活清理已完成，并且传输通道和原生定位信息仍然可用。命令被拒绝、传输中断、超时或取消都不算结束。"

